<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant groups in Nigeria's Niger state killed at least 30 civilians in a reprisal attack and later kidnapped a Saudi national, while armed men killed 13 National Guard members and an attack killed 13 soldiers in Sanam. Bandits razed a village and killed three people in Niger, and jihadists threatened to cut off a town in northern Mali. Communal clashes between Kambari and Fulani groups in Niger left 74 dead, prompting the governor to order an investigation and provide compensation. Insurgents are now employing off-the-shelf drones in attacks. The conflict caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE43LVl0bXp0UVl1d19NRDFQdDdFcnFtZTlHOTRRNGtXTlNiNU1vcGg4aGxNbEtyQmFfSTEybzZGTkpBSFhUa3NldVkwZGo1Yld4SC1pZDJQVDJuMGs?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOUW5aeXpDUldIYjR5RlZ2bVdyUHFKZUtRcEUwTERNc3ZTRVFWTlNRSEZjV05VMVNyNG1KTXZNelVaQUJVaUlObUlqYXl5MV85b0hrTDdJMlA4YVcyanRXVVhrV19vUjBqRmR2WDBzcnY2MlFsTjdoS0paNGFTQWdESk5Lcm9GeWNSbUN6dkJwbDhwWk5WR1FqWXVWS1dYVjFVcElvNDd2RS11NnprbVVUdWl3cVVkVC16?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQVHZmV2MtaGtLcUNwZlhJQ3lGLVRRZGZqV2hQbWpSakFTUWk1OWd5NlNlYUo4OHJQWHhhYjhrUDhDNTV1N09ycEtSSHd5RU85ZW1JRnhkc2pUdHZfSzN6Q2xGRi1OVDZra1U4MDg4cGxKYmhhanUxQy1iYmNSRFhhdkJBSENLUkNBSmwwWFFGUkc2cl9rNkc4cWpUbU41RklXSWhIa1Jqemc2RmhoaDkxenNFalB3S0JPQ0VFR3l0TkpuR0o2VGYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxON0RjeHRWcGl1ZElENEhBX0x2blI3b2w1OC1vZ1U3SklwRTV5ajRTWVRXczVBTlBrN0JkQldfZEozLTU1b3AxUDJTM3dnX3FoTldYTmZVZWF3dW4xSFM0c2gtWS1yTWRvSmlsRDhMa1ZncXIybHVKaXlhZE9FSHNaanRCckd2RHA0cHVOVldWUmVKMGhUV1JUZG95amFmQ3oyWjBYNmZVSl80ZzhT?oc=5&quo